{
  "name": "request_policy_grant",
  "description": "Request an independent finite approval for one currently accepted team policy. Uses its real workload, recipe, current requester rights and original policy authority; creates no capture or personal result access. Retry the same actor/client and idempotency key after an unknown reply; original expiry and budgets never reset. A different current human action-approver reviews through get_grant and decide_review.",
